## SQ-LGM-11 | pufferfish broth gives Comfort 2400 and Nausea 100, no poison
@group A
@commands Bot eats `largemeals:pufferfish_broth`; `/data get entity` the bot `ActiveEffects`
@pass Comfort 2400 ticks (the comfort_nourishment R5 length for a bowl food under 10 hunger, 120 s; comfort_nourishment.md section 9, food dump 2026-11-19; the plan's A4 "Comfort 1 min" was the upstream value before that rule) and Nausea (`minecraft:nausea`) 100 ticks; no poison (LGM-22)
@fails `MealItems.java` not in the nested jar. r1120nv batch fault: the row wanted Comfort 1200
@jars creativedelight
@from batches/r1113/c2_a1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> pbot spawn c2b 300.5 -60 296.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> pbot hunger c2b 4
> pbot hold c2b largemeals:pufferfish_broth 1
> pbot eat c2b
waitlog verb=pbot.useitem bot=c2b end=finish item=largemeals:pufferfish_broth 20
> cdevtest player c2b
expect verb=player name=c2b effects=\S*farmersdelight:comfort:0:2[34]\d\d\b
expect verb=player name=c2b effects=\S*minecraft:nausea:0:\d+
reject verb=player name=c2b effects=\S*minecraft:poison
look Nausea about 100 ticks
> effect clear c2b
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ .*error=

