## SQ-BBQ2-08 | shulkers drop one mollusk with a knife; End's meat recipes and cans take the mollusk
@group A
@commands 30 knife kills of a shulker through `loot spawn` by a knife bot; then recipe dumps: End's meat-to-slice cut gone, Ender's cut kept, the stuffed shulker (pot and heatless), Canned Shulker Flesh, End's roasted shulker meat
@pass the dropped items are only `endersdelight:shulker_mollusk` (30, one per roll) and shulker shells, no `ends_delight:shulker_meat`; `ends_delight:food/shulker_meat_slice` not found; `endersdelight:cutting/shulker_filet` mollusk -> 2 filets; both stuffed shulker recipes, the canned shulker recipes and the roasted shulker meat smelting take the mollusk (or filet), none names End's meat
@fails two items a roll: End's knife modifier still on (repackedEnds overlay `loot_modifiers/add_shulker_meat.json`); End's meat in a recipe: the merge list `merges_ends_delight.json` not read (`[swaps] ... item merge(s)` line) or a script still names `i.shulker_meat`
@reviewed 2026-11-20
> forceload add 2192 -16 2224 16
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> pbot spawn q8k 2200.5 -60 0.5 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 2
> pbot hold q8k farmersdelight:iron_knife 1
> summon minecraft:shulker 2204 -60 2 {NoAI:1b,Invulnerable:1b,PersistenceRequired:1b,Tags:["q8s"]}
sleep 1
repeat 30
> execute as q8k run loot spawn 2206 -60 4 kill @e[type=minecraft:shulker,tag=q8s,limit=1]
end
sleep 3
> cdevtest items 2206 -59 4 1.5 keep
waitlog \[cdevtest\] verb=items done= 30
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=items items=\S*\bendersdelight:shulker_mollusk:30\b
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=items items=\S*ends_delight:shulker_meat
> cdevtest rdetail ends_delight:food/shulker_meat_slice
> cdevtest rdetail endersdelight:cutting/shulker_filet
> cdevtest rdetail stuffed_shulker
> cdevtest rdetail canned_shulker
> cdevtest rdetail roasted_shulker_meat
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail id=endersdelight:cutting/shulker_filet .*ingredients=\S*endersdelight:shulker_mollusk
expect \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail id=endersdelight:cooking/stuffed_shulker .*ingredients=\S*endersdelight:shulker_mollusk
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail id=ends_delight:food/shulker_meat_slice serializer=
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=rdetail .*ingredients=\S*ends_delight:shulker_meat\b
look the stuffed_shulker_cooked_manual_only, canned_shulker and roasted shulker lines name the mollusk or filet
# 2026-11-18: Canned Shulker Flesh effects (owner): Nausea 10 s plus a 50% chance of Levitation II 4 s
look eat Canned Shulker Flesh about 6 times: Nausea every time, Levitation II on about half (AppleSkin / JEED tooltip lists both)
> kill @e[tag=q8s]
> kill @e[type=minecraft:item]
> pbot remove q8k
